        "subject": "LU-15120 mdc: do not assert on a transno in an error reply",
        "message": "LU-15120 mdc: do not assert on a transno in an error reply\n\nmdc_clear_replay_flag() treated a reply that reported an operation\nerror while also carrying a non-zero transno as an impossible state.\nAn unexpected reply can hit that combination.  Log the event and\nleave the request off the replay list.\n\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 ltvm llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I64c9edc70267408e3c992dbc01216fde853ebbe5\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/70335\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Alex Zhuravlev <azhuravlev@thelustrecollective.com>\nReviewed-by: Marc Vef <mvef@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
